cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this derived ontology, please cite it and the original WCO Data Model 4.3.0."
title: "WCO Data Model 4.3.0 Ontology (derived knowledge base)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-31"
url: "https://w3id.org/wco-dm/4.3.0"
license: "No license granted over WCO source data; see NOTICE.md"
abstract: >-
  An OWL 2 DL ontology, SKOS code-list catalogue, SHACL shapes and static
  visual explorer derived from the official WCO Data Model 4.3.0 LIB and OIS
  workbooks. This is an independent derived work, not an official WCO
  publication.
keywords:
  - WCO
  - customs
  - data model
  - OWL
  - SKOS
  - SHACL
  - linked data
